## Why This Is Asked
Tests data governance skills: masking, policy registry, lineage, and performing under peak load in CNPA.

## Key Concepts
- Data masking across HTTP, Kafka, and DB
- Policy registry with versioning
- Data lineage and auditability
- Performance impact and verification under load

## Code Example
```javascript
function maskPII(value, policy) {
  // naive example: redact emails/phones per policy
  if (!value) return value;
  if (policy.hideEmails && /\\S+@\\S+/.test(value)) {
    return value.replace(/[^@]+@[^.]+\\.[^.]+/, 'REDACTED@domain');
  }
  if (policy.redactDigits) {
    return value.replace(/\\d/g, 'X');
  }
  return value;
}
```

